{"category_id":"6a5dd80467bf62345b1ba73f","label_id":[],"sort":2,"status":1,"type":"content","bg_img":"https:\/\/oss.lcweb01.cn\/jzt\/6a5d900c3b7c8a0bdb25998e\/image\/20260813\/2f865e67db9f2db2d01e999d1dca75bc.jpeg","title":"原料与工艺双重赋能 GRONDE 格朗德构建高端轴承品质护城河","column_id":"6a5dd7b35ef06b193f2b9a3a","site_id":"6a5d900c3b7c8a0bdb25998e","intro":"轴承的使用寿命、承载能力与稳定性，源头取决于原材料与加工工艺。德国 GRONDE 格朗德坚持从源头把控产品性能，形成四大核心竞争优势。","is_top":0,"create_time":"2026-07-23 10:29:59","update_time":"2026-08-13 18:25:55","readnum":0,"details":"<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">轴承的使用寿命、承载能力与稳定性，源头取决于原材料与加工工艺。德国 GRONDE 格朗德坚持从源头把控产品性能，形成四大核心竞争优势。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">原材料层面，全线采用高纯净度进口轴承专用钢材，钢材杂质含量更低、金相组织更加稳定，显著强化轴承抗疲劳、抗磨损能力，适配矿山、冶金、风电等恶劣工况。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">加工制造环节，依托全自动化精密磨床生产线，实现微米级尺寸公差控制，保障批量产品精度稳定、一致性突出。密封结构创新采用多重迷宫 + 接触式复合密封方案，有效阻挡粉尘、水汽、杂质侵入设备内部，延长润滑周期，大幅降低企业设备维护频次。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">在品控端，GRONDE 格朗德执行严苛出厂标准，所有轴承 100% 完成无损探伤、振动分级、噪音检测、载荷测试，做到全检出厂。依靠完整质控链条，格朗德持续为各类重型工业装备提供持久可靠的运转解决方案。<\/p>","id":"6a671d9d40fc4b0d535dd423","gl_list":[]}